  "comments": "Different types of sides are known.<br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Obverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span> - at bottom stalks snuggle to ribbon, 4 left stalks start from right ones, smaller grains in wreath, marked on photo grain has triangle shape.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span> - at bottom stalks snuggle to ribbon, 4 left stalks start from right ones, large grains in wreath, marked on photo grain has rhombic shape.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span> - at bottom stalks protrude from ribbon, out of left stalks one starts from ribbon and other 3 start from right ones.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">4</span> - at bottom stalks protrude from ribbon, out of left stalks 2 start from ribbon and other 2 start from right ones.<br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/624a077dcd41d.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/624a077dcd41d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"199\" height=\"110\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Reverse</span><br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span> - details closer to center, wide &quot;A&quot;.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span> - details closer to rim, wide &quot;A&quot;.<br />\r\nDie <span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span> - script narrow, especially visible in thickness of letter &quot;I&quot;, numerals &quot;10&quot; short, tall &quot;A&quot;.<br />\r\nPicture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev.<br />\r\n<a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/624a078b21b84.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/624a078b21b84.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"110\" /></a><br /><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-style:italic;\">Combinations</span><br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>: 1963, 1965, 1968, 1970, 1971, 1982-1985.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">1</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>: 1967, 1972, 1978-1981.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">2</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">B</span>: 1973.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">3</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">A</span>: 1986, 1987.<br />\r\n<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">4</span>+<span style=\"font-weight:bold;\">C</span>: 1988-1990.",
